---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Blog"
description: "Marketing, sotuv va brending haqida amaliy maqolalar — Hamkor marketing agentligi."
permalink: "/blog/"
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Blog</span>
    <h1>Marketing haqida amaliy maqolalar</h1>
    <p class="lead">Nazariya emas — bizneslar bilan ishlashda uchragan real vaziyatlar va ulardan chiqqan xulosalar.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if collections.maqolalar.length %}
    <div class="posts reveal stagger">
      {% for p in collections.maqolalar %}
      <a class="post-item reveal" href="{{ p.url }}">
        <div class="post-date">
          <time datetime="{{ p.data.sana | iso }}">{{ p.data.sana | sana }}</time>
          {% if p.data.turkum %}<span>{{ p.data.turkum }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="post-body">
          <h3>{{ p.data.title }}</h3>
          {% if p.data.qisqacha %}<p>{{ p.data.qisqacha }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty">
      <h3>Maqolalar hali qo'shilmagan</h3>
      <p>Birinchi maqolani yozish uchun admin panelga kiring: <code>/admin</code> → Maqolalar → New Maqolalar.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
